{"version":1,"content":"<p>颱風薔琵襲台，令當地航空交通及活動大受影響。</p><p>日劇天王木村拓哉的歌手老婆工藤靜香，臨時更改航班，昨日(22日)下午提早抵達當地，為明日(24日)將在台北舉行的演唱會做準備。</p><p>雖然行程臨時有變，但仍有不少粉絲收到消息後，特地前往機場接機。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.720402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:55:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:07.052458+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:07.052458+00:00","content_hash":"eebf76becf002ba2f4652634a966a2c401d06d83f2a7ba944acf977d05aa4bf2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}